  m_text: The most common brick type is basic, with no special effects. There are
    also bricks for each main element. Elemental bricks deal more damage to the player
    but are weak to certain elements. For example, the fire brick is weak to water.
    Certain elements even have unique interactions with different brick types!
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
