  m_text: A ball will be formed once a ball mold receives ten of a single resource.
    If a ball mold has less than ten of a resource, it will create a basic ball,
    so be sure to place all molds, even if you do not have enough resources! Removing
    a ball mold returns all inserted resources to their respective generators.
